":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122736","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122736.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122736.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-24T17:10:38Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen changing editor language, all editor translation domains are cleared and new translations are loaded. However, since English is not a Translation, the clear/load process was skipped.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes switching to English properly clear loaded translations.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNot sure why the clearing even happens tbh. Maybe it's to save memory? It causes problems when translating addons, because any translation injected to editor's domains have to be re-added, which is rather problematic (you have to propagate translation notification again, because UI updates before re-adding translations).\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repi